# Barracks: spawns friendly NPC units up to a per-barracks alive limit; each spawn spends
# "Barracks spawn energy" from its internal store, so unit production needs a cable feed.
# On a 6x6x6 m box. Spawned origin 3.0 above ground.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a small KEEP - a stone hall (the root), a timber
# upper storey, a dark stepped roof and a staff crystal on its peak, a stone TOWER with a dark cap at each of the
# four corners, a dark gate in the -Z face and two red banners over it. The child pieces are render-only.
